          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "k2h",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "k2g",
              "text": "Some imagery on this site is computer-generated or otherwise illustrative rather than photographic. It is there to communicate design intent, spatial arrangement, and the character of an installation. It is not a photograph of a specific completed property, and it does not depict a guaranteed outcome.",
