        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "k2n",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "k2m",
              "text": "Any third-party product, brand, or manufacturer name appearing on this site remains the property of its owner. We use such names only to describe equipment or systems factually. Their appearance does not imply that we are an authorised dealer, certified partner, or endorsed by that company, unless we say so expressly in writing.",
